    "Name": "Inferno INF-NOC",
    "Details": "A fire support configuration, an ER Medium Laser is in each torso. Like the primary configuration, an MML-5 is carried in the side torsos. For the main firepower, a Thunderbolt 15 missile launcher is mounted in the center torso. The right torso carries two tons of Thunderbolt ammo and two tons of MML ammunition in a CASE II protected bay. Similarly, CASE II protects a ton of MML ammunition and two more tons of Thunderbolt ammo in the left torso.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
